      "role": "user",
      "content": "exactly. it's exhausting. people talk about \"resilience\" like it's this superpower, but what if the biology is just stronger? it feels like i'm just dragging out a tragedy that's already been written. if the path is already set, then why am i even struggling so hard to stay on it? it feels like i'm just being cruel to myself by trying to force a version of life that my own body isn't even designed to sustain.",
